# UI building blocks — where to extend

When adding Epic screens, extend existing shells/components; do not fork layouts.

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Parent chrome | `src/components/shell/parent-shell.tsx` |
| Tutor chrome | `src/components/shell/tutor-shell.tsx` |
| Admin chrome | `src/components/shell/admin-shell.tsx` |
| Page title block | `PanelPageHeader` |
| Nav link + active | `PanelNavLink` + `panel-icons` |
| Avatar | `UserAvatar` |
| Account photo upload | `ProfilePhotoForm` + `server/actions/profile.ts` |
| Public listing | `listings/listing-detail.tsx` (Superprof pattern) |
| Browse cards | `listings/browse-results.tsx` |
| Trust copy | `TrustStrip` |
| Notifications | `NotificationBellHost` in layouts only |
| Design tokens | `app/globals.css` |

New routes under `app/(parent|tutor|admin)/…` inherit the segment shell. Marketing stays in `app/(marketing)/` with `MarketingShell` / `MarketingNav`.
